 "premise": "Keiji Kiriya, a raw recruit in a war against alien invaders called Mimics, dies on his first battle and wakes up the previous morning, trapped in a time loop. Each repetition makes him a better soldier, and he discovers that the elite fighter Rita Vrataski once faced the same loop. This two-volume manga adapts Hiroshi Sakurazaka's light novel, later the basis of the film Edge of Tomorrow.",
